Defects found:

1. **Check that cannot fail for mismatch**: line 71.
Exact input:
```text
ssot/iv-iron-hf/iv-iron-hf.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT99999999"}]}}
ssot/not-fcm/not-fcm.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT99999999"}]}}
ssot/sglt2-hf/sglt2-hf.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT88888888"}]}}
ssot/not-empag/not-empag.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT88888888"}]}}
```
Consequence: the script exits 0 and writes records even though none of the named P22 overlaps exists; it only proves “some overlap,” not “the expected overlap matches.”

2. **ZERO CONFLATED WITH ABSENT**: line 58.
Exact input:
```text
ssot/iv-iron-hf/iv-iron-hf.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[]}}
ssot/sglt2-hf/sglt2-hf.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT03057977"}]}}
ssot/x/x.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT03057977"}]}}
```
Consequence: an explicitly empty included set is reported as “no included set,” so empty and absent/corrupt data are indistinguishable.

3. **ZERO CONFLATED WITH ABSENT**: line 67.
Exact input:
```text
ssot/iv-iron-hf/iv-iron-hf.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT1"}]}}
ssot/fcm-hf-review/fcm-hf-review.json = {}
ssot/x/x.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT1"}]}}
ssot/sglt2-hf/sglt2-hf.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT2"}]}}
ssot/y/y.json = {"inputs":{"trials":[{"nct":"NCT2"}]}}
```
Consequence: the script claims it computed against every other topic’s `inputs.trials` while silently treating a topic with absent `inputs.trials` as an empty overlap source.

